<title>USA: TABLE-Netsmart Technologies Q2 shr loss up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Netsmart Technologies Q2 shr loss up.</headline>
<dateline>ISLIP, N.Y. 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ended June 30:</p>
<p>				     Six Months	Three Months</p>
<p>				1997	1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenue	    $3,313,000 $4,936,000 $1,741,000 $2,375,000</p>
